title AVG-06 Rotate and Revoke API Keys and Signing Secret
participant Checker_or_Client_Admin
participant Admin_Portal_Backend
participant AVG
==ROTATE API KEY==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:rotate key
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:check max 2 non-revoked keys
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:create new key; set old key Expiring
AVG-->Admin_Portal_Backend:new key (only hash stored)
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:show new key once (then prefix + last 4 only)
AVG->AVG:after 24 h, revoke Expiring key automatically
==REVOKE API KEY==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:revoke key (reason; warning if last active key)
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:revoke keyId
AVG->AVG:clear key cache; reject key within 60 s
AVG-->Admin_Portal_Backend:revoked
==ROTATE SIGNING SECRET==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:rotate signing secret
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:create new secret
AVG->AVG:sign new results with new secret; old secret valid 24 h
AVG-->Admin_Portal_Backend:new secret (stored encrypted)
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:show new secret once
==REVOKE SIGNING SECRET==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:revoke signing secret (reason)
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:revoke secret at once
alt TWO NON-REVOKED KEYS ALREADY
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:Revoke the expiring key before rotating again.
end
alt MAKER, VIEWER OR ZETRIX OPS
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:403 access denied
end
